    <string name="sheet_settings_recmode_staged_toast">Recordings in this mode appear on the folder button, next to the gear on the home screen.</string>
    <string name="sheet_settings_recmode_help_msg">Normal (recommended)\nYour video is ready in the gallery as soon as you stop recording. Best for everyday use.\n\nIn stages\nThe video is saved in a special safe way while you record. If your phone turns off, the battery dies or the app closes, you do NOT lose your recording.\nThe catch: after recording, it does not go to the gallery yet. You open the folder button next to the gear on the home screen and convert it to a normal video. Converting can take a while for long videos, but it runs in the background.\nGood for long recordings, or when you cannot afford to lose the video.</string>
